WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:02.992
Roxy flew over Metro City.

2
00:00:02.993 --> 00:00:06.853
"I probably won't get to see my friends today," she thought.

3
00:00:06.854 --> 00:00:08.839
Roxy was disappointed.

4
00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:11.754
Suddenly she had an idea.

5
00:00:11.755 --> 00:00:14.661
"The Mighty Man actor has super powers now!

6
00:00:14.662 --> 00:00:17.429
I can teach him to fight villains.

7
00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.338
Then I'll have a helper.

8
00:00:19.339 --> 00:00:21.784
I can spend more time with my friends.

9
00:00:21.785 --> 00:00:27.431
It's a perfect plan!"

10
00:00:27.432 --> 00:00:32.284
Roxy found Detective Smith outside True Savings Bank.

11
00:00:32.285 --> 00:00:35.846
"You can't rob the bank yet, Detective," Roxy said.

12
00:00:35.847 --> 00:00:38.652
"Someone else is robbing it now."

13
00:00:38.653 --> 00:00:40.824
Detective Smith rolled his eyes.

14
00:00:40.825 --> 00:00:44.148
"Very funny, Rocket Girl."

15
00:00:44.149 --> 00:00:46.990
"Did you see the bank robber?" Roxy asked.

16
00:00:46.991 --> 00:00:49.861
"No, but a witness saw her."

17
00:00:49.862 --> 00:00:53.551
The detective opened his notepad. "He said she's—"

18
00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:57.982
Ka-boom! A big orange brute crashed through the wall.

19
00:00:57.983 --> 00:01:00.288
She was holding a sack of money.

20
00:01:00.289 --> 00:01:02.758
"Who are you?" Roxy shouted.

21
00:01:02.759 --> 00:01:08.400
"I'm Rumbler!" The robber made a fist. Pow!

22
00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:12.343
"Ouch!" Roxy slammed into a steel pole.

23
00:01:12.344 --> 00:01:14.078
It fell over.

24
00:01:14.079 --> 00:01:18.747
Rumbler laughed.

25
00:01:18.748 --> 00:01:20.692
Roxy ran toward the villain.

26
00:01:20.693 --> 00:01:22.882
Suddenly she heard a voice in her head.

27
00:01:22.883 --> 00:01:25.275
"Don't fight Rumbler!"

28
00:01:25.276 --> 00:01:27.926
"It's the voice from last night."

29
00:01:27.927 --> 00:01:30.137
Roxy's legs grew heavy.

30
00:01:30.138 --> 00:01:32.682
"It's trying to control me!"

31
00:01:32.683 --> 00:01:36.273
"Yes, I am," the voice said.

32
00:01:36.274 --> 00:01:38.616
Roxy used her super strength.

33
00:01:38.617 --> 00:01:42.544
Slowly she forced her legs to move.

34
00:01:42.545 --> 00:01:46.595
"Get . . . out of my . . . head!"

35
00:01:46.596 --> 00:01:48.154
The voice was gone.

36
00:01:48.155 --> 00:01:52.083
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

37
00:01:52.084 --> 00:01:54.311
They bounced off Rumbler.

38
00:01:54.312 --> 00:01:56.958
Rumbler knocked Roxy backward again.

39
00:01:56.959 --> 00:02:02.781
"Oof!" Roxy lay near the steel pole.

40
00:02:02.782 --> 00:02:04.748
She grabbed it and swung.

41
00:02:04.749 --> 00:02:07.608
Bam! Rumbler fell onto the pavement.

42
00:02:07.609 --> 00:02:11.391
Roxy quickly twisted the pole around her.

43
00:02:11.392 --> 00:02:15.472
The villain calmed down. "Thanks!"

44
00:02:15.473 --> 00:02:17.550
Roxy was confused.

45
00:02:17.551 --> 00:02:19.808
"Why are you thanking me?"

46
00:02:19.809 --> 00:02:23.380
"I didn't want to rob that bank," Rumbler said.

47
00:02:23.381 --> 00:02:26.872
"My real name is Private Benson.

48
00:02:26.873 --> 00:02:30.192
I was near Old Misty yesterday.

49
00:02:30.193 --> 00:02:34.313
After it blew, I changed."

50
00:02:34.314 --> 00:02:38.179
She looked down at herself. "Into this!"

51
00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:40.591
"Whoa," Roxy said.

52
00:02:40.592 --> 00:02:44.051
"A voice in my head controlled me."

53
00:02:44.052 --> 00:02:47.987
Private Benson sighed. "It's gone now."

54
00:02:47.988 --> 00:02:53.164
Roxy gasped. "That voice tried to control me too!"

55
00:02:53.165 --> 00:02:56.268
She tapped her chin.

56
00:02:56.269 --> 00:02:58.058
"I'll take you to Dr. Chen.

57
00:02:58.059 --> 00:03:01.395
She's studying the energy from Old Misty."

58
00:03:01.396 --> 00:03:06.368
Private Benson nodded. "Her lab is on the military base."

59
00:03:06.369 --> 00:03:12.577
Roxy picked up Private Benson and shot into the sky.

60
00:03:12.578 --> 00:03:16.020
"The Mighty Man actor is at the base," Roxy thought.

61
00:03:16.021 --> 00:03:23.375
"I can't wait to tell him my perfect plan!"

62
00:03:23.376 --> 00:03:25.223
They soon arrived at the lab.

63
00:03:25.224 --> 00:03:28.457
Dr. Chen was wiping slime off a computer.

64
00:03:28.458 --> 00:03:33.086
"Rocket Girl!" The Mighty Man actor stomped toward Roxy.

65
00:03:33.087 --> 00:03:37.638
"I hate super powers!"

